<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1500s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 16th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1500s BCE, 63 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 22 were founded and 7 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Hittite Empire, the Assyrian Empire and the Elamite Confederation.</p></header>
